## Done means

Every Phase 0 probe fails on the previous commit, then
passes twice after the fix.

No new subcommands.
No VERSION file.
No sh -c in cli/ or registry/.
Help names == main.oo dispatch names.
cmd_add.oo split; every .oo file <= 256 lines.
OODA_COMPILER only. No bin/oodac fallback.
sbom calls run_ooda_pm_sbom.
../registry is not a silent vendor.
min_pin is not a stale v0.210.0 floor.

Say "go" to start at Phase 0 (probes only).
